	["Inscripción de Sylvaris"] = "Inscription of Sylvaris",
	["Santuario de la Vida · Valle de Aurelia"] = "Shrine of Life · Aurelia Valley",
	["Éramos seis, y el mundo respiraba entre nuestras manos.\nIgnar daba el fuego, Lunaria la luz, Morvak guardaba a los muertos, Tempus sostenía el espacio y Aetherion medía el tiempo. Yo, Sylvaris, hacía brotar la vida.\n\nSi lees esto, el sello se debilita. Busca a mis hermanos. No confíes en las voces que prometen eternidad."] = "We were six, and the world breathed between our hands.\nIgnar gave fire, Lunaria gave light, Morvak watched over the dead, Tempus held up space and Aetherion measured time. I, Sylvaris, made life bloom.\n\nIf you are reading this, the seal is weakening. Find my brothers and sisters. Do not trust the voices that promise eternity.",
	["Tablilla agrietada"] = "Cracked tablet",
	["Santuario de la Vida"] = "Shrine of Life",
	["...las raíces de este valle beben de mi último aliento. Mientras crezcan árboles aquí, una parte de mí seguirá vigilando..."] = "...the roots of this valley drink from my last breath. As long as trees grow here, a part of me will keep watch...",
	["Inscripción de Ignar"] = "Inscription of Ignar",
	["Santuario del Fuego · Dunas de Kharsa"] = "Shrine of Fire · Kharsa Dunes",
	["Mi fuego quemó montañas enteras en la Guerra de los Guardianes. No me arrepiento.\nAetherion era mi hermano, y aun así lo enfrenté. Lo que hablaba por su boca ya no era él.\n\nEl desierto que pisas fue un bosque antes de nuestra batalla."] = "My fire burned entire mountains in the War of the Guardians. I do not regret it.\nAetherion was my brother, and still I faced him. What spoke through his mouth was no longer him.\n\nThe desert you walk on was a forest before our battle.",
	["Diario de un explorador"] = "An explorer's journal",
	["Encontrado entre las ruinas"] = "Found among the ruins",
	["Día 12. La arena aquí está caliente incluso de noche. Los guías del Imperio del Sol no quieren acercarse. Dicen que la piedra \"recuerda\" el fuego de un dios."] = "Day 12. The sand here is hot even at night. The guides of the Sun Empire refuse to come closer. They say the stone \"remembers\" the fire of a god.",
	["Inscripción de Morvak"] = "Inscription of Morvak",
	["Santuario de la Muerte · Bosque Sombrío de Morvane"] = "Shrine of Death · Shadow Forest of Morvane",
	["Yo guardaba el paso entre la vida y la muerte. Por eso fui el primero en verlos: humanos que no morían.\nSu sangre había bebido del Eclipse. Se curaban de cualquier herida, pero el sol los quemaba como castigo.\n\nLos llamamos vampiros. Fueron los primeros en caer. No serán los últimos."] = "I guarded the passage between life and death. That is why I was the first to see them: humans who did not die.\nTheir blood had drunk from the Eclipse. They healed from any wound, but the sun burned them as punishment.\n\nWe called them vampires. They were the first to fall. They will not be the last.",
	["Lápida sin nombre"] = "Nameless gravestone",
	["Santuario de la Muerte"] = "Shrine of Death",
	["\"Aquí descansa quien quiso vivir para siempre.\nNo cavéis. No está muerto.\""] = "\"Here rests the one who wanted to live forever.\nDo not dig. He is not dead.\"",
	["Inscripción de Lunaria"] = "Inscription of Lunaria",
	["Santuario de la Luz · Picos del Velo"] = "Shrine of Light · Veil Peaks",
	["Cuando el Eclipse tocó el mundo, el cielo se apagó durante cien días.\nAetherion nos dijo que era el precio de la paz: sin guerras, sin enfermedad, sin muerte. Sonaba tan sabio...\n\nNo quería destruirnos. Quería que fuéramos parte de él."] = "When the Eclipse touched the world, the sky went dark for a hundred days.\nAetherion told us it was the price of peace: no wars, no sickness, no death. It sounded so wise...\n\nHe did not want to destroy us. He wanted us to become part of him.",
	["Oración tallada"] = "Carved prayer",
	["Santuario de la Luz"] = "Shrine of Light",
	["Que la luz del alba nunca se apague.\nQue ningún sello se rompa mientras quede un solo valiente."] = "May the light of dawn never fade.\nMay no seal ever break while a single brave soul remains.",
	["La grieta del sello"] = "The crack in the seal",
